msgstr "Записей в журнале пока нет."

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:485
#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:752
msgid "Date"
msgstr "Дата"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:485
#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:754
msgid "Result"
msgstr "Результат"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:496
msgid "View full log"
msgstr "Смотреть весь журнал"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:517
msgid "General"
msgstr "Общие"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:518
msgid "Forms"
msgstr "Формы"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:519
msgid "Content rules"
msgstr "Правила содержимого"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:520
msgid "Email domains"
msgstr "Домены email"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:521
msgid "Rate limit & timing"
msgstr "Ограничение частоты и тайминг"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:522
msgid "Consent"
msgstr "Согласие"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:523
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "Логирование"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:524
msgid "Error messages"
msgstr "Сообщения об ошибках"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:528
msgid "Country"
msgstr "Страна"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:537
msgid ""
"Server-side submission rules for Contact Form 7. Field names must match the "
"CF7 form-tag names."
msgstr ""
"Серверные правила отправки для Contact Form 7. Имена полей должны совпадать "
"с именами тегов формы CF7."

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:550
msgid "Enable protection"
msgstr "Включить защиту"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:552
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Режим"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:552
msgid "Enforce"
msgstr "Принудительно"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:557
msgid "No Contact Form 7 forms were found."
msgstr "Формы Contact Form 7 не найдены."

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:562
msgid "Protect this form"
msgstr "Защищать эту форму"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:565
msgid "Name field"
msgstr "Поле имени"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:566
msgid "Maximum name length"
msgstr "Максимальная длина имени"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:569
msgid "Message field"
msgstr "Поле сообщения"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:570
msgid "Minimum message length"
msgstr "Минимальная длина сообщения"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:571
msgid "Maximum message length (0 = disabled)"
msgstr "Максимальная длина сообщения (0 — отключено)"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:574
msgid "Email field"
msgstr "Поле email"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:575
msgid "Consent field"
msgstr "Поле согласия"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:576
msgid "Generic error field"
msgstr "Поле для общих ошибок"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:576
msgid ""
"Used when a matched rule has no field of its own to attach the error to "
"(e.g. rate limiting, too-fast submission)."
msgstr ""
"Используется, когда у сработавшего правила нет собственного поля для "
"привязки ошибки (например, при ограничении частоты или слишком быстрой "
"отправке)."

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:595
msgid "Block URLs/domains"
msgstr "Блокировать ссылки/домены"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:596
msgid "Block @ character"
msgstr "Блокировать символ @"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:597
msgid "Block email patterns"
msgstr "Блокировать шаблоны email"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:598
msgid "Block HTML tags"
msgstr "Блокировать HTML-теги"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:599
msgid "Block BBCode-like markup"
msgstr "Блокировать разметку в стиле BBCode"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:601
msgid "Reject select fields whose value isn't one of their own options"
msgstr ""
"Отклонять select-поля, если значение не входит в их собственный список опций"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:601
msgid ""
"Applies automatically to every [select] field on a protected form, "
"independent of the fields checked above — catches scripted submissions that "
"bypass the dropdown."
msgstr ""
"Применяется автоматически ко всем полям [select] на защищённой форме, "
"независимо от полей, отмеченных выше — ловит скриптовые отправки, обходящие "
"выпадающий список."

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:604
msgid "Max digits % (0 = disabled)"
msgstr "Макс. % цифр (0 — отключено)"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:605
msgid "Max uppercase % (0 = disabled)"
msgstr "Макс. % заглавных букв (0 — отключено)"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:607
msgid "Forbidden words/phrases, one per line"
msgstr "Запрещённые слова/фразы, по одной в строке"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:611
msgid "Blocked domains"
msgstr "Заблокированные домены"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:611
msgid "One per line. Subdomains are blocked too."
msgstr "По одному в строке. Поддомены также блокируются."

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:616
msgid "Allowed values"
msgstr "Разрешённые значения"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:616
msgid ""
"One per line. If empty, the plugin validates against the CF7 select tag "
"values when available."
msgstr ""
"По одному в строке. Если поле пустое, плагин проверяет по значениям тега "
"select CF7, если они доступны."

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:621
msgid "Enable IP rate limiting"
msgstr "Включить ограничение частоты по IP"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:623
msgid "Maximum attempts"
msgstr "Максимум попыток"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:624
msgid "Period, minutes"
msgstr "Период, минут"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:627
msgid "Enable minimum completion time"
msgstr "Включить минимальное время заполнения"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:628
msgid "Minimum seconds"
msgstr "Минимум секунд"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:630
msgid "Block duplicate messages from same IP"
msgstr "Блокировать повторные сообщения с одного IP"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:631
msgid "Duplicate window, minutes"
msgstr "Окно проверки дублей, минут"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:635
msgid "Require configured consent field"
msgstr "Требовать настроенное поле согласия"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:636
msgid "The consent field is selected separately for each protected form."
msgstr "Поле согласия выбирается отдельно для каждой защищённой формы."

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:640
msgid "Enable security logging"
msgstr "Включить журнал безопасности"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:641
msgid "Log successful submissions"
msgstr "Записывать успешные отправки"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:647
msgid "IP storage"
msgstr "Хранение IP"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:650
msgid "Anonymized"
msgstr "Анонимизировано"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:651
msgid "Full IP"
msgstr "Полный IP"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:652
msgid "Do not store"
msgstr "Не сохранять"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:656
msgid "Retention, days"
msgstr "Хранение, дней"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:658
msgid ""
"Name and message contents are never written to the plugin log. The submitted "
"email address itself is never stored either — only its domain (e.g. "
"\"example.com\"), to help spot patterns."
msgstr ""
"Содержимое имени и сообщения никогда не записывается в журнал плагина. Сам "
"адрес email также не сохраняется — только его домен (например, "
"«example.com»), чтобы помочь выявлять закономерности."

